                    notice to existing subscribers.
                </p>

                <h3>4.2 Billing and Renewal</h3>
                <p>
                    Paid subscriptions are billed on a recurring basis (monthly
                    or annually, depending on your selection). By subscribing,
                    you authorize us to charge your chosen payment method at the
                    beginning of each billing cycle. Subscriptions automatically
                    renew unless cancelled before the renewal date.
                </p>

                <h3>4.3 Free Trials</h3>
